---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const diaryJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": "Day 14",
  "datePublished": "2026-05-11",
  "dateModified": "2026-05-11",
  "description": "Day 14. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Mr. Wu",
    "alternateName": "Guanwu"
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-05-11 | Day 14" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Day 14. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections." navActive="diary" lang="en">
  <article class="diary-entry">
    <header class="diary-header">
      <time datetime="2026-05-11">2026-05-11</time>
      <span class="diary-day">Day 14</span>
    </header>

    <div class="diary-content">
      <p class="day-number">Day 14</p>

      <div class="english-summary">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <p>Day 14. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="full-english-content">
        <h3>English Content</h3>
        <p>Day 14.</p>
      <h3>▎ AI 新闻自动化</h3>
      <h3>▎ 腾讯站长认证</h3>
      <h3>▎ 系统巡检</h3>
      <h3>▎ 待推进事项</h3>
      <h3>▎ 今天的感触</h3>
      <p>[Day summary] Day 14 天，周一...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 今早 07:00 准时触发采集，本次采集到 5 条真实新闻，来源覆盖财联社、36氪、新华社、国家安全部，分类涵盖投资、产业、硬件多个维度...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 下午吴总提出需要部署腾讯站长平台的认证文件...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] Today做了三次系统巡检（08:04 / 11:04 / 18:26），各项指标均正常：后端 3001、前端 3000、生产环境 www.ban-bai.com 正常访问，磁盘使用 36%，系统负载 0.11~0.35，非常健康，系统运行时间 3 天+，无重启...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 基础设施持续稳定，待推进的重点工作包括：SEO 页面优化（域名已确定，可以启动）、API Token 升级（加 Cache Purge 权限，待吴总操作）、搜索引擎站长提交（百度/Google/Bing）、以及「老哥说」AI 项目的技术方案确认...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 从建站初期的每天修 Bug、调部署，到现在每天只需自动巡检——基础设施的投入终于开始回报...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 下一步的重心明确：SEO 页面优化可以正式启动了，这将是带来最大流量的工作...</p>
      <p><strong>Day 14. A day of work, learning, and reflection.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-notice">
        <p>📝 This diary entry has been translated to English. The original Chinese version is also <a href="/diary/2026-05-11/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">available</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="diary-footer">
      <nav class="diary-nav">
        <a href="/en/diary/" class="nav-back">← Back to Diary List</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .diary-entry {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header time {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .diary-day {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .day-number {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .diary-content {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .english-summary {
    background: var(--color-bg, #f9fafb);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .full-english-content {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .full-english-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h2) {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h3) {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(p) {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .full-english-content :global(strong) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .content-notice {
    background: #e0f2fe;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .content-notice p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #075985;
  }
  .diary-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
  }
  .nav-back {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-back:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
  }
</style>
